<title>JAPAN: Showa Denko shares higher on earnings announcement.</title>
<headline>Showa Denko shares higher on earnings announcement.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Showa Denko KK were sharply higher on the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) on Tuesday morning after the company announced its earnings results on Monday.</p>
<p>By 0027 GMT, Showa Denko&quot;s shares were up 18 yen, or 7.47 percent, at 259.</p>
<p>Showa Denko was the top percentage gainer and most active on the first section of the TSE.</p>
</text>
